1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,600
Wheee!

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,323
Wheee! Was that fast or slow?

3
00:00:04,573 --> 00:00:05,823
Shout it out!

4
00:00:07,823 --> 00:00:09,557
Super fast, Pip!

5
00:00:09,557 --> 00:00:10,835
You zoomed!

6
00:00:12,685 --> 00:00:13,938
Can I go again?

7
00:00:13,938 --> 00:00:15,608
And again, and again?

8
00:00:16,158 --> 00:00:17,166
But Pip,

9
00:00:17,166 --> 00:00:19,089
I want a turn too.

10
00:00:19,339 --> 00:00:21,962
There is only one sled.

11
00:00:22,512 --> 00:00:23,751
Oh. One sled,

12
00:00:23,751 --> 00:00:25,223
and two friends.

13
00:00:25,473 --> 00:00:26,319
Hmm.

14
00:00:26,869 --> 00:00:28,547
What can we do?

15
00:00:28,547 --> 00:00:29,759
Any ideas?

16
00:00:33,059 --> 00:00:34,619
We can take turns!

17
00:00:34,619 --> 00:00:36,624
First one friend slides,

18
00:00:36,624 --> 00:00:37,961
then the other.

19
00:00:38,511 --> 00:00:39,767
Taking turns!

20
00:00:39,767 --> 00:00:41,415
Lulu can go first.

21
00:00:41,965 --> 00:00:43,891
Thank you, Pip!

22
00:00:44,441 --> 00:00:48,373
And I will stay right here at the bottom, watching.

23
00:00:51,623 --> 00:00:54,615
Pip ran to the hill, and flump!

24
00:00:54,865 --> 00:00:57,632
Into a soft snow pile!

25
00:00:58,182 --> 00:00:59,465
Where is Pip?

26
00:00:59,465 --> 00:01:00,989
Can you see him?

27
00:01:01,239 --> 00:01:02,407
Guess!

28
00:01:04,407 --> 00:01:06,473
I see two brown ears!

29
00:01:06,473 --> 00:01:07,419
Hee hee!

30
00:01:09,269 --> 00:01:11,442
Ta-da! I'm a snow puppy!

31
00:01:11,992 --> 00:01:13,058
Silly Pip!

32
00:01:13,058 --> 00:01:15,026
On the hill, we walk.

33
00:01:15,276 --> 00:01:17,072
No running.

34
00:01:17,622 --> 00:01:18,958
Walk, walk, walk.

35
00:01:18,958 --> 00:01:20,026
Got it, Mama!

36
00:01:20,576 --> 00:01:21,845
Shake, shake, shake!

37
00:01:21,845 --> 00:01:23,942
Can you shake off the snow with me?

38
00:01:27,042 --> 00:01:27,726
Up, up,

39
00:01:27,726 --> 00:01:28,753
up the hill.

40
00:01:28,753 --> 00:01:30,464
Let's count our steps!

41
00:01:31,014 --> 00:01:32,255
Count with me!

42
00:01:32,255 --> 00:01:34,518
One, two, three, four, five!

43
00:01:35,318 --> 00:01:37,859
Are we up or down now?

44
00:01:39,859 --> 00:01:42,051
Up! We are up at the top!

45
00:01:43,901 --> 00:01:44,902
Lulu's turn!

46
00:01:44,902 --> 00:01:46,305
Sit down, hold on,

47
00:01:46,305 --> 00:01:47,440
feet in front.

48
00:01:47,990 --> 00:01:49,475
Is the path clear?

49
00:01:49,475 --> 00:01:51,596
Look! Is anyone in the way?

50
00:01:53,596 --> 00:01:54,600
All clear!

51
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,994
Go when you are ready, Lulu.

52
00:01:58,844 --> 00:01:59,896
Here I go.

53
00:01:59,896 --> 00:02:01,918
Slowly, slowly, wheee!

54
00:02:02,468 --> 00:02:04,718
Was Lulu fast or slow?

55
00:02:06,718 --> 00:02:08,061
Slow and steady!

56
00:02:08,061 --> 00:02:08,910
Go, Lulu!

57
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:10,825
I like slow.

58
00:02:10,825 --> 00:02:12,554
Slow is fun too!

59
00:02:14,404 --> 00:02:16,350
Now it's the next turn.

60
00:02:16,350 --> 00:02:17,847
Whose turn is it?

61
00:02:19,847 --> 00:02:21,178
Pip's turn!

62
00:02:21,178 --> 00:02:22,224
Go, Pip!

63
00:02:24,374 --> 00:02:26,682
Wheee! Fast, fast, fast!

64
00:02:28,532 --> 00:02:30,554
Let's play Fast and Slow!

65
00:02:30,554 --> 00:02:32,937
Wave your arms fast, like Pip!

66
00:02:34,537 --> 00:02:37,076
Now wave them slow, like Lulu.

67
00:02:37,326 --> 00:02:38,710
Slow, slow.

68
00:02:40,510 --> 00:02:42,409
Pat your knees fast!

69
00:02:42,409 --> 00:02:43,400
Now slow!

70
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:45,916
Hee hee!

71
00:02:45,916 --> 00:02:46,894
Fast is fun,

72
00:02:46,894 --> 00:02:48,392
and slow is fun too!

73
00:02:50,242 --> 00:02:51,875
Lulu's turn again!

74
00:02:51,875 --> 00:02:53,664
Oh! My sled stopped!

75
00:02:54,214 --> 00:02:57,267
It's stuck on a little snow bump.

76
00:02:57,817 --> 00:02:59,472
What can Lulu do?

77
00:02:59,472 --> 00:03:00,548
Any ideas?

78
00:03:02,548 --> 00:03:03,557
Wiggle, Lulu!

79
00:03:03,557 --> 00:03:05,260
Can you wiggle with her?

80
00:03:05,510 --> 00:03:06,913
Wiggle, wiggle!

81
00:03:08,713 --> 00:03:10,131
Wiggle, wiggle.

82
00:03:10,131 --> 00:03:11,705
It's still stuck!

83
00:03:13,555 --> 00:03:15,882
I'll sit behind you, Lulu.

84
00:03:16,132 --> 00:03:17,998
Let's wiggle together!

85
00:03:18,548 --> 00:03:20,378
Ready? Count with us!

86
00:03:20,378 --> 00:03:21,826
One, two, three!

87
00:03:25,726 --> 00:03:27,736
We're sliding together!

88
00:03:27,736 --> 00:03:28,431
Wheee!

89
00:03:28,981 --> 00:03:30,066
Look at that!

90
00:03:30,066 --> 00:03:31,151
Taking turns,

91
00:03:31,151 --> 00:03:32,913
and helping each other.

92
00:03:33,463 --> 00:03:36,386
Sharing the sled is the best fun of all!

93
00:03:38,236 --> 00:03:41,561
Warm cocoa for my two kind sliders!

94
00:03:41,811 --> 00:03:44,093
Just warm, not hot.

95
00:03:44,643 --> 00:03:47,412
How many marshmallows are in my cup?

96
00:03:47,662 --> 00:03:48,816
Count them!

97
00:03:50,816 --> 00:03:53,527
One, two, three marshmallows!

98
00:03:54,077 --> 00:03:55,568
Blow on it first.

99
00:03:55,568 --> 00:03:57,356
Can you blow with us?

100
00:03:57,606 --> 00:03:58,590
Whoo!

101
00:04:00,190 --> 00:04:02,567
Mmm. Thank you, Mama!

102
00:04:04,417 --> 00:04:06,673
Sing the Snow Slide Song with us,

103
00:04:06,673 --> 00:04:08,051
and do the actions!

104
00:04:08,651 --> 00:04:09,570
Up, up,

105
00:04:09,570 --> 00:04:11,500
up the hill we go.

106
00:04:11,750 --> 00:04:14,557
March your feet in the snow!

107
00:04:14,957 --> 00:04:16,562
Sit down, hold on,

108
00:04:16,562 --> 00:04:17,861
feet in front.

109
00:04:18,111 --> 00:04:19,649
Hold on tight!

110
00:04:20,049 --> 00:04:22,795
One, two, three, and wheee!

111
00:04:23,045 --> 00:04:24,910
Arms up high!

112
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:26,781
My turn, your turn,

113
00:04:26,781 --> 00:04:28,252
fun for you and me!

114
00:04:30,352 --> 00:04:31,560
One more time!

115
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,910
March and wheee!

116
00:04:33,310 --> 00:04:34,229
Up, up,

117
00:04:34,229 --> 00:04:36,158
up the hill we go.

118
00:04:36,408 --> 00:04:39,216
March your feet in the snow!

119
00:04:39,616 --> 00:04:41,923
One, two, three, and wheee!

120
00:04:42,173 --> 00:04:43,539
Arms up high!

121
00:04:43,939 --> 00:04:45,670
My turn, your turn,

122
00:04:45,670 --> 00:04:47,402
fun for you and me!

123
00:04:48,202 --> 00:04:52,070
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

124
00:04:52,670 --> 00:04:53,666
Next time,

125
00:04:53,666 --> 00:04:56,349
Lulu Lamb wraps a surprise gift.

126
00:04:56,599 --> 00:04:58,792
What's inside the box?

127
00:04:59,392 --> 00:05:00,609
Bye bye, friends!

128
00:05:00,609 --> 00:05:03,104
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
